ebp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=960f328ea229ed0c7eed52e8c1af15e3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8ddaccd4/uploads/origins/7527821d-f832-4636-bf61-6381e3909315?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=960f328ea229ed0c7eed52e8c1af15e3, https://si.imgix.net/8ddaccd4/uploads/origins/7527821d-f832-4636-bf61-6381e3909315?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c95f9904ea5b9150f0fac3803dff0d64 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8ddaccd4/uploads/origins/7527821d-f832-4636-bf61-6381e3909315?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9689ade024a9933624ebc800908c8dd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "お久しぶりです～！\n\n今回はFF14の水着のうちの子を書いていただきたいです！\n\n資料(水着の例)\n[https://photos.app.goo.gl/G41mgCzbKjUisj5b6]\n[https://photos.app.goo.gl/vfdKBPpPAkEvnrEh7]\n設定など\n[https://twitter.com/HAKUrs0804/status/1686356912630337536]\n\nシチュエーションとかは無いですかぽめさんの思ううちの子を書いていただきたいです！\n\n以上よろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@cha_pome/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5a98d76d/uploads/origins/50eb3707-bb57-43f4-bba4-b3f47200f7cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9abd0ca1d85d2baf7824076f17880da2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5a98d76d/uploads/origins/50eb3707-bb57-43f4-bba4-b3f47200f7cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9abd0ca1d85d2baf7824076f17880da2, https://si.imgix.net/5a98d76d/uploads/origins/50eb3707-bb57-43f4-bba4-b3f47200f7cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=35f442d7a73e6aa2aa10387eefb1fa3c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5a98d76d/uploads/origins/50eb3707-bb57-43f4-bba4-b3f47200f7cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a860d25de828307e6cf204511ee6cc12 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして。\n\n今回は私のFF14でのキャラクターのイラストを描いて貰いたく依頼させていただきました。\nポーズ、背景はおまかせします。\n\nよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/k93Oyan", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@cha_pome/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6dad770b/uploads/origins/64b1488b-4fa2-45ad-957c-9501d207d381?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91da07997a912471ec16df763ccfb1e0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6dad770b/uploads/origins/64b1488b-4fa2-45ad-957c-9501d207d381?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91da07997a912471ec16df763ccfb1e0, https://si.imgix.net/6dad770b/uploads/origins/64b1488b-4fa2-45ad-957c-9501d207d381?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6546e2b02fca996b8f6bdea8e66c0f7a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6dad770b/uploads/origins/64b1488b-4fa2-45ad-957c-9501d207d381?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c0a92f989a1b5dac61e338485cf30cd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\nTwitterであなたの作品に出会い、ポートレートスタイルのアートが好きです！\n最近、新しいヒーラーギアに変えたのですが、週末のカジュアルな服装のようで、とても気に入っています。\n\nもし可能なら、この新しく追加された服を着た私のララフェルのアートをお願いしたいです。\n\n私のララフェルは紺色の髪で、ゲーム内の身長は最小です。\n以下は、この服を着た私のララフェルのリファレンスです：\nhttps://imgur.com/a/67BTMOW\n\nどんなかわいいポーズでもかまいません！ただし、最終的なポーズや背景はお任せしたいと思います。\n\nありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@cha_pome/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2b9f105b/uploads/origins/731b16c6-df38-403a-bf67-424213d0f429?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70cb29629d63fa7b2a55509da7952d06", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2b9f105b/uploads/origins/731b16c6-df38-403a-bf67-424213d0f429?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70cb29629d63fa7b2a55509da7952d06, https://si.imgix.net/2b9f105b/uploads/origins/731b16c6-df38-403a-bf67-424213d0f429?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=329aa1a037f0eb839744e6348653e089 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2b9f105b/uploads/origins/731b16c6-df38-403a-bf67-424213d0f429?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09896b1ffe4ce872df3e26301c9b0803 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1044829710221328504/1113132354509221918/ffxiv_04142023_133552_165.png\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1044829710221328504/1113132353783611402/ffxiv_04142023_132911_152.png\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1044829710221328504/1113132353783611402/ffxiv_04142023_132911_152.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@cha_pome/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7e2c97f2/uploads/origins/5d47c5c7-7e71-4a49-8121-4ac68457d326?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9eac68567cd95b287151ac30e3e5f330", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7e2c97f2/uploads/origins/5d47c5c7-7e71-4a49-8121-4ac68457d326?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9eac68567cd95b287151ac30e3e5f330, https://si.imgix.net/7e2c97f2/uploads/origins/5d47c5c7-7e71-4a49-8121-4ac68457d326?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2213b12a3563928eebfaf3bc37814034 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7e2c97f2/uploads/origins/5d47c5c7-7e71-4a49-8121-4ac68457d326?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93f08b2dd4d65dafd16bd53919edbf4e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you! Please draw my character however you please. She enjoys eating and is a little mischievous. Her hair is a dark purple rather than a blue. But the highlights are red. Green eyes. I will leave the rest to your judgement.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/wJM3QUA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@cha_pome/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3f82fda5/uploads/origins/114c84dc-a731-48aa-8330-176c87bfcecb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76723ecc7513b81933924d040f8f0ddb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3f82fda5/uploads/origins/114c84dc-a731-48aa-8330-176c87bfcecb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76723ecc7513b81933924d040f8f0ddb, https://si.imgix.net/3f82fda5/uploads/origins/114c84dc-a731-48aa-8330-176c87bfcecb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b891508af8baa4cf169d9edfda1e7c92 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3f82fda5/uploads/origins/114c84dc-a731-48aa-8330-176c87bfcecb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b92d3245128f101ceb67311c67b0798 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi!\nCould you draw my friend's character?\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/u3ae1pfh9BAvVPub9\nIf that outfit is too difficult, could you draw her wearing the fat cat hoodie? (hood down)\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/uCVi5aGfE5VAHQGc7\n\nA cute pose with a smile\nThe intent is to gift my friend an icon\nMy friend loves the fat cat minion, so if it's possible to to draw their character holding the cat\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/u3ae1pfh9BAvVPub9", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@cha_pome/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/291af658/uploads/origins/53c6b410-555d-4243-a35f-c555885ab152?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c48b51d5d88c1cb58f0aa8a14f34426", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/291af658/uploads/origins/53c6b410-555d-4243-a35f-c555885ab152?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c48b51d5d88c1cb58f0aa8a14f34426, https://si.imgix.net/291af658/uploads/origins/53c6b410-555d-4243-a35f-c555885ab152?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4804f2e8f94b4ce9badf015e83aa9650 2x, https://si.imgix.net/291af658/uploads/origins/53c6b410-555d-4243-a35f-c555885ab152?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2142cef4518314a0afbbd586b3